  "body": "Direct-PR: daily refresh of the README milestone table, under the operator's standing authorization (docs only, self-merged when CI is green).\n\nThe problem: the \"Lots done\" column was dated 2026-11-06 (M2 23 of 28, M3 35 of 43).\n\nWhat changed: the date and two counts (M2 25 of 28, M3 37 of 43), taken from the daily board render (`tooling/roadmap`). Nothing else.\n\nTests: docs only, no code.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CEBkjmFApUaMrewUvD)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated the milestone table date to November 7, 2026.\n  * M2 progress now shows 25 of 28 lots, up from 23; M3 shows 37 of 43, up from 35. M1 remains complete at 40 of 40 lots.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
